INV-02 Container Substrate 5.0.0

This package contains no third-party source code and has no runtime dependencies
beyond the CPython standard library.

Standards implemented from their public specifications (no code copied):
  - OCI Image Format Specification v1.1 and OCI Distribution Specification v1.1
  - OCI Runtime Specification v1.1
  - RFC 8032 (Ed25519) — written from the RFC's algorithm description; verified
    against the RFC's published test vectors in tests/test_trust_policy.py
  - DSSE v1 envelope / in-toto Statement v1 / SLSA Provenance v1 (predicate type URIs only)
  - CycloneDX 1.5 and SPDX 2.3 (field names only, for SBOM ingestion)
  - Prometheus text exposition format 0.0.4, W3C Trace Context (traceparent)

Test tooling: tests/integration/probe.c is original; it is compiled at test time.
